1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=19628 '''Li Ke''' 李恪] [19628] Identified in Hu(1) Su's funerary inscription for his descendant, Congpu [19631] (q.v), as Jianwang and 8th son of Tang Xianzong, Li
2 CONC (2) Shun [19249], but in XTS, 70B.50b as the 6th son, which is the identification I use. Li(2) Bian [19629], orphaned as a youth, is identified as a Xuzhou resident and as Ke(2)'s descendant--XTS shows no descendants [the whole ge
2 CONC nealogy may be fabricated]. I am identifying Ke(2) as the person who moved and chronological logic would make him the grandfather of Bian. — [https://www.geni.com/projects/CBDB-Hartwell-collection/46406 RMH]
