2 TITL The Alâeddin Mosque in Konya was built during the reign of Masud I. The building served as the “Mosque of the Throne” for the Seljuq Sultans of Rûm and contains the dynastic mausoleum. Completed in 1220-1221 by Kaykobat I. Facade 
3 CONC on Aleddîn Caddesi
