1 NAME Muhammad al-Faqih al-Muqaddam
1 NAME //
2 GIVN
2 SURN
2 NICK Muhammad al-Faqih al-Muqaddam [-18]
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1178
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tarim
