1 NOTE {geni:about_me} BIO ONE:
2 CONT "Hazrat Syed Mohammed Mehdi-e-Maud a.s Khalifatullah Taba-e-Taam-e-Rasool alla s.a.s Khatim-e-Vilayat-e-Mohammediyah s.a.s. born on Monday 14th Jamadi-ul-Awwal 847 Hijri at Jaunpur India (now in UP state) ded and left to heavens a
2 CONC t Farha, Afghanistan on 19th Zi-Qaida 910 Hijri."
2 CONT
2 CONT BIO TWO:
2 CONT "The noble Syed Muhammad, the Promised Mahdi, the Caliph of Allah, the perfect follower of the Prophet, and the seal of the sainthood of Muhammad, was born on Monday, September 9, 1443 CE, in Jaunpur, India, and passed away in Far
2 CONC ah, Afghanistan, on April 23, 1505 CE."
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES;
