2 CONT
2 CONT 6.         daughter .  Her parentage and marriage are suggested by Ruy Gonzalez de Clavijo when he records the death of "Zaratan" and adds that he was childless by his marriage with the "daughter of the emperor of Trebizond"[138].
2 CONC   Her father is not named in this source, but from a chronological point of view it is probable that he was Emperor Alexios III.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' MUTAKHARTAN [Tahartan] Emir of Ergincan [Erzindjan] (-before 1404).  
