2 CONT https://scroll.in/article/1091961/what-sufi-saint-hazrat-nizamuddin-auliyas-life-says-about-moral-conduct-and-service-to-humanity
2 CONT https://www.rekhta.org/authors/hazrat-nizamuddin-auliya/profile
